| Level | Name | Value | Purpose |
|-------|------|-------|---------|
| 0 | Deep Void | `#0e0e0` | Page canvas, the base of the stack |
| 1 | Carbon | `#1c1c1c` | Card surfaces, testimonial tiles, elevated panels |
