- **Weights:** 400, 500, 700
- **Sizes:** 14, 16, 20, 24, 32, 48, 64, 80, 112
- **Line height:** 1.00 (display) / 1.30 (body & UI)
- **Letter spacing:** -0.03em constant across all sizes
